<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">

    <p>Hi {!Receiving_User.FirstName},</p>

    <p>Ownership of an RFQ has changed.</p>

    <p>Key Details:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>RFQ Number:</strong> {!Case.CaseNumber}</li>
      <li><strong>Opportunity:</strong> {!Case.Opportunity__c}</li>
      <li><strong>Customer:</strong> {!Case.Account}</li>
      <li><strong>Previous Owner:</strong> ##PREVIOUS_OWNER##</li>
      <li><strong>New Owner:</strong> {!Case.OwnerFullName}</li>
      <li><strong>Current Status:</strong> {!Case.Status}</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Please review the RFQ in Salesforce and continue the investigation.</p>

    <p>
      <a href="{!Case.Link}">{!Case.CaseNumber}</a>
    </p>

    <p>Thank you,<br>
    Carlton Packaging CRM</p>

  </body>
</html>